#. Description of the plugin
#: wm-newsticker.php
msgid ""
"A Gutenberg block for animated news tickers with scroll, fade, slide and "
"typing animations."
msgstr ""
"Gutenbergov blok za animirane pasice z novicami z učinki drsenja, "
"prelivanja, pomikanja in pisalnega stroja."

